xt":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"abstract":[],"title":"Cliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"}}}